      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In my opinion there is no point to this. Its text in a profile box. \n\nI understand what you mean by this, but for a bio specifically, just don't put your entire life story in it and only put in it what you are okay with others seeing.\n\nBecause, in my experience half the time when I see people complaining about their bio it is because they dump their entire life saga into it and then trolls have a field day or people make fun of them. You're putting it there in your profile for the world to see. \n\nYou have full control over this and it will not hinder your experience in any lobby.  Unlike some other features that you don't have complete control over.\n\nIts a much easier fix then a lot of other things on the platform.",
